% Blocks world (the Examples page)
%
% The Logical English twin of an Epilog ruleset, written by the Epilog translator
% from blocks.rules and blocks.data (kept in sources/). Every expected answer is
% EpilogJS's own (Stanford's Epilog interpreter) on the same ruleset and dataset.
% Source: the Epilog Examples page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/rulesheet.php?theory=blocks
%
